    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm working on my dissertation regarding the sociology of meritocracy. For my literature review, I need to flesh out the critical side of the debate. Can you summarize the most compelling arguments that suggest IQ and standardized testing are not valid measures of \"merit\" in a social context?",
